<Essay title="Fear Is Not A Control: Why Waiting Is the Costliest Risk Posture | Jack P. Flaherty"
  description="Nobody owns the technology decision, so fear makes it. Jack P. Flaherty on why waiting is not a control and the three questions that replace it."
